!! Pronunciation note

The written tone marks are third–third (nǐ hǎo). In ordinary connected speech the first syllable is usually realized with a rising tone (approximately ní hǎo); see [[Grammar/Tones and Pinyin]].

!! In context

你好！ — Nǐ hǎo! — Hello!

